<!-- **************************************************************************
	NbRotation* values need to be the same accross qualities
	When we export data, the realtree batches are created according to the
	simulation handle, amongst other things, and if the rotationGroup values
	differ between the editor and standalone, trees in the same batch could
	end up using different simulation handles and thus create inconsistencies
     ***********************************************************************-->	
